	(text "Its secondary lives on the HV1 side, referenced to the bridge DC- (P1_BUS-, one 0R Kelvin tie at the bank), so\nprimary-secondary sees only functional stress. HV1 -> PELV crosses three reinforced parts: UCC12050 power\n(VIOWM 1697 VDC), AMC3330 AN1 (1700 VDC), ISO7720F OC trips (2121 VDC). ECO-10: reinforced creepage at\nthese footprints (8 mm packages < 10 mm at PD2 / 1000 V: PD1 coating or slots, as PV-PORT)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 91.56 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "063a2abf-07b3-5e48-af23-0a4cac1ead21")
	)
	(text "AN1 DRIVER -> AMC3330 (+/-1 V IN, GAIN 2, 1.44 V CM OUT, 0.2 OHM)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 104.06 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "0a72c227-ffc3-5668-9522-f58d3a4011a7")
	)
	(text "OPA2388 A: MID + 16 x LPF(AN1_P - AN1_N) (100k / 1.60M || 620p C0G); B buffers MID. 5V_B ladder 2.1k/402R/402R/2.1k\n(0.1 %, ratiometric): trips at +5.02 / -5.02 A. TLV3502 out LOW = trip -> TRIP_N. AMC3330 fail-safe\n(-2.57 V, HV side dead) and an open AN1 line trip it too."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 330.4 274.808 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "190835a4-7f64-54c3-9753-6ebb933f41f8")
	)
	(text "Primary jumper in the AC path B1_ACA -> XP_A (positive = out of leg A). LEM p12 filter 10R / 4.7n on Uout.\nOPA4388 D buffers Uout (Rout 30 ohm), C buffers Uref (130-300 ohm)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 167.62 74.532 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "23f33160-3e40-54ff-b678-2bbcd0eae7f5")
	)
	(text "DC-FLUX WINDOW +/-5 A ON AN1 (PELV, TAU 0.99 MS)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 330.4 206.66 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "5b426039-47d5-5a73-b336-c0a80045d22f")
	)
	(text "AN2: APWM (L1 driver, 400 kHz, duty 88-10 % for AIN 0.6-4.5 V) -> 10.0k / 100k / 1 uF (tau 10 ms) ->\nfollower: 0.9 x 3.3 V x duty, 0.2-2.8 V. AN3: REF3030E 3.0 V -> 100R -> NTC -> 1k -> GND, follower, 0-2.73 V.\nOutputs 49.9R (CTRL: <= 100 R source), single-ended on AGND."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 365.62 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "76bd9ee6-3969-53c5-9067-57ce40469944")
	)
	(text "AN2 MODULE TEMPERATURE, AN3 TRANSFORMER WINDING HOT SPOT (PELV)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 290.96 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "76e1c467-9fea-5a5c-ade1-ade3767b490d")
	)
	(text "INSULATION: THE HOB 130-P IS NOT THE PELV BARRIER (BASIC 1000 V ONLY)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 19 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "84a51c3f-876d-5072-8d39-8fecd24b1aed")
	)
	(text "OPA4388 A: INP = Vcm + k(Uout - Uref), B: INN = Vcm - k(Uout - Uref): R1 = R3 = 10k, R2 = 1.56k, + leg divider\n7.87k / 1.96k from Uref_B (Vcm 0.500 V, R_th ~ R2). VIN = 0.3128 (Uout - Uref) -> AN1 = 5.005 mV/A differential:\n0 A = 0 V, +/-1.25 V at +/-250 A, +/-1.56 V at the HOB rails; CTRL G 0.402 -> 0.62-1.88 V at its ADC."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 194.16 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "86c617db-db61-5880-8e1c-1ab30d082c02")
	)
	(text "REF3030E ladder 909R/1.69k/412R (0.1 %) on H5V: trips at +211.1 / -209.9 A on Uout/2 (20.0k/20.0k + 10 pF). TLV3502 out\nHIGH = OK -> ISO7720F (default LOW: a dead HV side reads TRIP) -> OCH_OK / OCL_OK. ~0.78 us to the gate."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 278.46 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "c071527e-d73c-553a-8dfe-211845094b04")
	)
	(text "TRANSFORMER PRIMARY CURRENT: HOB 130-P (DC-1 MHZ, +/-250 A, 8 MV/A)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 167.62 19 0)
		(effects
			(font
